  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Hot_Dog_Stand?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Hot_Dog_Stand.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925222258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Hot Dog Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hot Dog Stand\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Hot Dog Stand</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 650,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  3 d 16 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 85</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Hot Dog Stand</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 75.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-19460\" title=\"Hot Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hot dogs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tofu-dog-19462\" title=\"Tofu Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tofu dogs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/corn-dog-19463\" title=\"Corn Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">corn dogs</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/onion-dog-24928\" title=\"Onion Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">onion dogs</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 650,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 3 days and 16 hours or 85 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to build the Hot Dog Stand. It gives players 41 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-19460\" title=\"Hot dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hot dog\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/tofu-dog-19462\" title=\"Tofu dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tofu dog\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/corn-dog-19463\" title=\"Corn dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Corn dog\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/onion-dog-24928\" title=\"Onion dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Onion dog\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-19460\" title=\"Hot Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hot Dog</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/tofu-dog-19462\" title=\"Tofu Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tofu Dog</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/corn-dog-19463\" title=\"Corn Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Corn Dog</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/onion-dog-24928\" title=\"Onion Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Onion Dog</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 75\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 76\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 78\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 80\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30 min\n</td>\n<td>45 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h\n</td>\n<td>1 h 15 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 25 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 38 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 51 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 3 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>4<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>4<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>370<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>367<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>529<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>306<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>44<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>44<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>63<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>36<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Hot Dog Stand originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to completely upgrade their machine.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 1,512 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Hot Dog Stand:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/80/Hot_Dog_Stand_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925231719\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Hot Dog Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Hot Dog Stand\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>72 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>288 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>1,152 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602234714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Mastery_II_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260605002649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery II 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a0/Hot_Dog_Stand_Mastery.png/revision/latest?cb=20180501173651\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hot Dog Stand Mastery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>15% faster</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/tofu-dog-19462\" title=\"Tofu Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tofu Dog</a> are commonly found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a> and may not sell quickly when sold at max price.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/onion-dog-24928\" title=\"Onion Dog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Onion Dog</a> can be used to master the machine as they don't need any dairy or sauce maker item. They can be sold quickly.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bath-kiosk-34840\" title=\"Bath Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bath Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cake-oven-3556\" title=\"Cake Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cake Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cupcake-maker-35636\" title=\"Cupcake Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cupcake Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"